elf-loop carries its capacity when its cost is negative and nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise. Capacities may be of an unsigned type, up to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int.max","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Computed by the network simplex with block-search pivots and strongly feasible trees.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Which optimum is returned when several exist is unspecified, but the same input always","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gives the same result. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supply"},{"text":" is called once per vertex in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":" order, then, for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each edge in position order, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"text":" and then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cost"},{"text":", before any work.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every capacity is at least zero; capacities, supplies and costs fit in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; Σ capacity × |cost| fits in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Cost","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (checked before solving, since it bounds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"total cost); 4(n + 1)(the greatest |cost| of a non-loop edge + 1) fits in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"solver’s artificial cost, with room for its potentials and reduced costs); the positive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supplies sum within ","type":"text"},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":